  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "LC009 (Missing AsNoTracking in read-only path) no longer flags methods that mutate the materialized entity and commit through a helper. A property mutation of the result — on the result local (stored directly into a single-assignment local), a foreach variable over it, or inline on the materializer, compound assignment and increment included — now marks the body as a write path, where the suggested AsNoTracking() would have silently dropped the cross-method save. DTO mutation, repointed locals, and collection-element replacement do not suppress.",
